WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.599
An announcement came over the radio.

2
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.822
"Taekuk crew, you are now free to move around."

3
00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:16.993
"Yippee!" shouted Jinwook.

4
00:00:16.994 --> 00:00:19.113
"Jinwook! Stop fooling around!

5
00:00:19.114 --> 00:00:22.785
We have lots of work to do!" Captain Peter scolded.

6
00:00:22.786 --> 00:00:25.827
But this was Jinwook's first time in space.

7
00:00:25.828 --> 00:00:30.713
He was too excited to work.

8
00:00:30.714 --> 00:00:37.280
"Now that we're in space, you can take your pressure suit off," Linda said with a smile.

9
00:00:37.281 --> 00:00:39.348
Jinwook could not believe it!

10
00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:42.259
It was his dream to travel in space.

11
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:49.185
He was about to begin his space adventure!

12
00:00:49.186 --> 00:00:53.277
Jinwook and the crew worked hard for several hours.

13
00:00:53.278 --> 00:00:58.098
Soon it was time for Jinwook's first meal in space.

14
00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:00.592
"It's not easy to eat in space.

15
00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:04.108
Eating in space takes practice," Adam said.

16
00:01:04.109 --> 00:01:09.124
"What do we eat?" Jinwook asked.

17
00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:16.281
"We can eat just about anything, but the food has to be made into a sticky paste," answered Captain Peter.

18
00:01:16.282 --> 00:01:18.781
Dinner was spaghetti!

19
00:01:18.782 --> 00:01:22.111
Mealtime in space is often playtime.

20
00:01:22.112 --> 00:01:25.373
Adam's favorite trick is playing with his drinks.

21
00:01:25.374 --> 00:01:30.906
In space, water floats in the air in big drops.

22
00:01:30.907 --> 00:01:36.166
"What's this for?" Jinwook pointed to the Velcro on his trousers.

23
00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:41.821
"That's Velcro. If we don't hold onto things, everything just floats around in space.

24
00:01:41.822 --> 00:01:45.916
So we use Velcro to hold things down," Adam explained.

25
00:01:45.917 --> 00:01:49.052
"Even this food tray has Velcro strips underneath.

26
00:01:49.053 --> 00:01:54.371
It can be attached to the wall! Watch!"

27
00:01:54.372 --> 00:01:58.960
"Do we float because there is no gravity in space?" Jinwook asked.

28
00:01:58.961 --> 00:02:03.622
"Gravity? Of course there's gravity," answered Adam.

29
00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:11.040
"But in orbit around Earth, there is very little gravity—almost zero—and you don't feel any weight.

30
00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:13.592
That's why it's so easy to move.

31
00:02:13.593 --> 00:02:17.517
That's why you can float in space.

32
00:02:17.518 --> 00:02:21.379
Look at Captain Peter," said Adam.

33
00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:24.262
"He's running on the exercise machine.

34
00:02:24.263 --> 00:02:29.173
Floating inside the space shuttle, we hardly use our bones and muscles at all.

35
00:02:29.174 --> 00:02:36.859
So to stay healthy, we have to exercise every day," he explained to Jinwook.

36
00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.808
"It's bedtime," Captain Peter said.

37
00:02:39.809 --> 00:02:42.531
Adam gave Jinwook a sleeping bag.

38
00:02:42.532 --> 00:02:45.427
"Make sure you attach your sleeping bag to something."

39
00:02:45.428 --> 00:02:51.553
Jinwook nodded, but he was too excited to sleep.

40
00:02:51.554 --> 00:02:54.727
Jinwook stayed up and looked out into space.

41
00:02:54.728 --> 00:02:58.964
"It's so amazing to be in space," he said to himself.

42
00:02:58.965 --> 00:03:04.209
Finally, Jinwook fell into a deep sleep.

43
00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.295
Jinwook was having a wonderful dream.

44
00:03:07.296 --> 00:03:11.359
He was telling his family and friends about his space adventure.

45
00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.908
"Ouch!" he cried suddenly.

46
00:03:13.909 --> 00:03:19.878
"Jinwook! I told you to attach your sleeping bag to something," said Captain Peter.

47
00:03:19.879 --> 00:03:24.272
"Wake up, Jinwook! Jinwook!"

48
00:03:24.273 --> 00:03:27.990
"Wake up, Jinwook!" his mom was saying.

49
00:03:27.991 --> 00:03:31.761
"Captain?" Jinwook called out sleepily.

50
00:03:31.762 --> 00:03:36.574
"Captain? It's Mom, Jinwook! You're late for school!"

51
00:03:36.575 --> 00:03:43.917
"School? There's no school aboard a spaceship," said Jinwook, waking up.

52
00:03:43.918 --> 00:03:50.376
"Spaceship? You must have been dreaming." His mother laughed.

53
00:03:50.377 --> 00:03:53.191
Jinwook picked up his book.

54
00:03:53.192 --> 00:03:57.722
"What happened to Captain Peter and Linda and Adam?

55
00:03:57.723 --> 00:04:00.020
Where are my Velcro trousers?"

56
00:04:00.021 --> 00:04:03.938
Jinwook spread his arms out.

57
00:04:03.939 --> 00:04:09.228
"Last night I had my first space adventure," he said excitedly.

58
00:04:09.229 --> 00:04:12.381
"Do you know what I want to be when I grow up?"

59
00:04:12.382 --> 00:04:20.295
"Let me guess—an astronaut?" His mother winked.
